{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S06、S13等段落的感受短语堆叠较密，纵向交替阅读容易分散注意力，Y的左右分栏更容易快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏更稳定，普通观众可以先读人物叙述，再扫右侧感受，短时间内比较容易定位信息。但X的重点放大和感受按音乐时机出现，让观众更容易抓住每段的心理转折，而且保留了更关键的细腻区别：舍不得的不是简单的旧生活，而是曾被当作自己人的亲近，同时又不愿重新忍受那些委屈。X从离开后的失落、对旧日亲近的怀念、重新面对孤独，到带着想念继续生活，前后呼应更充分，音乐变化也有更具体的对应，因此整体体验更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5af24a76-1608-4611-8252-6bbeae3c692d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061941594656Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:21:01.931113+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "286f4d55af0577b66df593e02d62e901f3b78e545d37dd0c3e0463152685b480", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too